{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44675","headline":"爱妾换马 · 法宣","name":"爱妾换马","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朱鬣饰金镳，红妆束素腰。\n似云来躞蹀，如雪去飘颻。\n桃花含浅汗，柳叶带余娇。\n骋光将独立，双绝不俱标。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}